1
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,239
Has the Xingyun Ranking been released?

2
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,079
My lady, your foresight is impeccable.

3
00:01:23,319 --> 00:01:24,200
Those girls

4
00:01:24,319 --> 00:01:25,879
heard that Cheng Qi got married

5
00:01:26,079 --> 00:01:26,920
and stopped buying books.

6
00:01:27,359 --> 00:01:29,359
Mr. Ling also heard the rumors

7
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:30,920
and started buying books by the box.

8
00:01:31,159 --> 00:01:32,760
Cheng Qi is about to fall off the Xingyun Ranking.

9
00:01:33,159 --> 00:01:34,159
Did you make sure

10
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:35,159
the bookshop knows?

11
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,959
As you ordered,

12
00:01:37,079 --> 00:01:38,159
his books can only

13
00:01:38,159 --> 00:01:39,400
be bought by the box.

14
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,760
Let's see how far he can go.

15
00:01:42,079 --> 00:01:43,120
I want him to know

16
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,400
that only I can

17
00:01:44,719 --> 00:01:45,840
give him what he wants.

18
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,159
Tell everyone,

19
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,760
if he comes to see me,

20
00:01:49,159 --> 00:01:50,599
bring him straight to me.

21
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,200
Yes.

22
00:01:59,000 --> 00:01:59,560
Serve the meal.

23
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,159
I'm full.

24
00:02:32,319 --> 00:02:33,000
I'll take my leave now.

25
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,400
Take your time.

26
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:42,879
What happened?

27
00:02:43,879 --> 00:02:45,520
My lord, you made your son-in-law angry.

28
00:03:02,439 --> 00:03:03,960
Everyone's been scrambling for books today.

29
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,159
I grabbed 500.

30
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:07,719
Not sure if it's enough for the Star Chart.

31
00:03:07,879 --> 00:03:08,840
Who told you to buy books?

32
00:03:10,639 --> 00:03:12,039
Wasn't it your note?

33
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:14,800
I told you not to take shortcuts.

34
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:18,680
But you said you wanted to be the top.

35
00:03:18,719 --> 00:03:19,680
I want to be the top,

36
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,159
but with my own strength.

37
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,360
What I'm doing now

38
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:23,960
is no different from them.

39
00:03:26,719 --> 00:03:27,400
Cheng Qi,

40
00:03:27,919 --> 00:03:29,199
I don't understand your rules.

41
00:03:29,759 --> 00:03:30,479
But you said

42
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:32,639
you like to write down the moving

43
00:03:32,719 --> 00:03:34,199
and warm emotions in life,

44
00:03:34,319 --> 00:03:35,000
and compile them into a book,

45
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:36,960
so that more people can see hope

46
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:37,759
and beauty,

47
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,680
and overcome the setbacks in life.

48
00:03:40,039 --> 00:03:41,039
But if I don't make it into the top ten,

49
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,439
how can I let others see it?

50
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:52,840
My dear,

51
00:03:53,439 --> 00:03:54,680
there's no need to do that.

52
00:03:55,479 --> 00:03:56,000
At worst,

53
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:58,039
just don't let so many people see it.

54
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,520
It's unnecessary.

55
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:04,439
You think I'm making a fuss?

56
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:05,199
No.

57
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,240
My lady.

58
00:04:06,439 --> 00:04:06,919
I...

59
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,400
Go return these books yourself.

60
00:04:09,719 --> 00:04:10,400
What are you waiting for?

61
00:04:10,719 --> 00:04:11,360
Move them now,

62
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,360
or I'll throw them away.

63
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:17,639
My lady.

64
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:18,800
Don't throw away the books.

65
00:04:18,879 --> 00:04:19,800
They are quite expensive.

66
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:21,000
How about you hit me?

67
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,959
It's embarrassing for you to get up.

68
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,120
If you don't throw the books,

69
00:04:24,439 --> 00:04:25,240
I'll get up.

70
00:04:33,399 --> 00:04:34,240
Who wants to hit you?

71
00:04:34,439 --> 00:04:35,920
I'm already tired of escorting every day.

72
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:53,120
Alright, my dear.

73
00:04:53,279 --> 00:04:54,600
Don't be upset.

74
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:58,759
Actually,

75
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,560
when preparing for the Starry Night,

76
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,560
I was very confident.

77
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,720
But I found

78
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,759
what I did was useless.

79
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,959
So I was frustrated.

80
00:05:15,319 --> 00:05:17,720
I was very surprised to see

81
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:18,879
the booklets you bought for me.

82
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,120
But I was also angry at myself for being useless.

83
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,639
So I said something stupid.

84
00:05:25,839 --> 00:05:27,040
Please don't mind.

85
00:05:27,879 --> 00:05:28,439
And

86
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:30,279
I'll earn back the money

87
00:05:30,639 --> 00:05:32,519
I spent on the album.

88
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,040
You don't have to.

89
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,720
700 taels!

90
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:43,839
Tell me in front of

91
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,879
the whole family,

92
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,399
what did you spend it on?

93
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:47,920
Buying books.

94
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,199
You're still reading books?

95
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:54,000
It's so ridiculous!

96
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:57,759
I spent dozens of taels on wine,

97
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,160
you were already pushing me around.

98
00:05:59,639 --> 00:06:01,199
Now you've spent so much money,

99
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:01,839
what do you have to say?

100
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:06,920
Jiaojiao,

101
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,680
what's going on?

102
00:06:09,279 --> 00:06:10,480
You've always been frugal,

103
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,639
how could you spend so much money?

104
00:06:12,839 --> 00:06:14,040
How can you be so reckless

105
00:06:14,439 --> 00:06:15,759
and still want to manage the household?

106
00:06:16,519 --> 00:06:16,959
Dad,

107
00:06:17,439 --> 00:06:18,360
you should be the judge.

108
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,199
It's not her fault.

109
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:22,600
I borrowed the money.

110
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,399
I'll pay it back to the agency as soon as possible.

111
00:06:27,759 --> 00:06:28,800
With your salary,

112
00:06:29,439 --> 00:06:30,839
do you plan to take ten years

113
00:06:31,879 --> 00:06:32,720
or eight years?

114
00:06:36,519 --> 00:06:37,439
I'll pay it back

115
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,720
within a month.

116
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:40,680
If you can't pay it back,

117
00:06:40,959 --> 00:06:41,639
what should we do?

118
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:46,240
If he can't repay,

119
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:47,519
I...

120
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,480
I'll give up the position.

121
00:06:59,439 --> 00:06:59,959
Uncle,

122
00:07:00,279 --> 00:07:00,959
is that okay?

123
00:07:03,439 --> 00:07:04,480
Whoever takes over

124
00:07:05,399 --> 00:07:07,040
must follow the rules of the agency.

125
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:08,240
This matter

126
00:07:08,959 --> 00:07:10,199
is up to my father.

127
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:11,839
Dad,

128
00:07:14,279 --> 00:07:15,399
I think it's fine.

129
00:07:16,279 --> 00:07:17,079
This month,

130
00:07:17,319 --> 00:07:19,560
Jiaojiao will take over the escort agency.

131
00:07:20,279 --> 00:07:20,920
Li Shi,

132
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,759
hand over your men to her.

133
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:23,600
But,

134
00:07:24,439 --> 00:07:24,800
Dad,

135
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,079
it's them who owe money,

136
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,519
not me.

137
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:30,360
They are also members of the escort agency.

138
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:33,839
If they owe money,

139
00:07:33,959 --> 00:07:35,399
it's the agency that owes money.

140
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:37,199
The whole agency should help.

141
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:40,680
It's better than letting those escorts be idle.

142
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:42,160
I admire your generosity.

143
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,480
Besides,

144
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:44,439
Uncle,

145
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:46,839
the escort business in this city has been in a slump.

146
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:49,759
It really needs to be reorganized.

147
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,319
I...

148
00:07:51,839 --> 00:07:52,879
It was Cheng Qi

149
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:54,480
who brought in new business for the agency.

150
00:07:54,839 --> 00:07:55,680
He must have a way.

151
00:07:55,759 --> 00:07:56,120
You...

152
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:58,079
I'm willing to help them pay back the money.

153
00:07:58,519 --> 00:07:59,480
I won't take

154
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,199
this month's escort fee.

155
00:08:00,519 --> 00:08:01,160
And me, and me.

156
00:08:01,519 --> 00:08:03,079
I won't take this month's escort fee either.

157
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:03,759
You...

158
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,600
It's settled then.

159
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,360
Get to work.

160
00:08:17,759 --> 00:08:18,839
What's going on with this list?

161
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:21,399
Cheng Qi had already fallen out of

162
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:22,759
the top ten of the Nebula List.

163
00:08:22,879 --> 00:08:24,959
But yesterday, Su came straight to the store

164
00:08:24,959 --> 00:08:26,120
and bought 500 copies.

165
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,439
So...

166
00:08:27,439 --> 00:08:28,759
How are you handling things?

167
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:31,319
Didn't you understand why you weren't

168
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:32,960
allowed to buy Cheng Qi's book?

169
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,720
This is no small amount of money.

170
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:37,200
Su Yuejiao

171
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:39,879
is willing to do this for him.

172
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:40,960
My Lady,

173
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,440
why don't we just change the list?

174
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:45,240
After all, only we know how many they bought.

175
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:47,879
Just post the list as usual.

176
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:48,919
Yes, My Lady.

177
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,399
If anything goes wrong again,

178
00:08:51,039 --> 00:08:52,440
you won't have to stay at the bookshop anymore.

179
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,080
Yes, My Lady.

180
00:08:55,279 --> 00:08:58,039
My Lady, are you planning to help Cheng Qi?

181
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,320
This way,

182
00:09:00,639 --> 00:09:01,679
it's actually more interesting.

183
00:09:02,399 --> 00:09:03,639
I want to see

184
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:05,240
how far he can go.

185
00:09:09,519 --> 00:09:10,519
From now on,

186
00:09:10,879 --> 00:09:13,159
anyone who buys a booklet of Cheng Qi's poems

187
00:09:13,799 --> 00:09:14,759
can enjoy three free escorts

188
00:09:15,039 --> 00:09:18,039
in the Imperial City with the silk.

189
00:09:18,159 --> 00:09:18,960
Valid for the month.

190
00:09:19,879 --> 00:09:21,600
Three escorts in the city

191
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,840
are not worth a book.

192
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:23,879
Will it work?

193
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,919
We'll know if we try.

194
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,240
But

195
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,399
these 1,000 books

196
00:09:28,399 --> 00:09:29,600
are 1,000 certificates.

197
00:09:29,759 --> 00:09:30,639
Do we have to

198
00:09:30,919 --> 00:09:32,480
copy them one by one?

199
00:09:40,879 --> 00:09:41,279
Tell me.

200
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,200
What do you want to engrave?

201
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,759
Thank you for your help.

202
00:09:47,799 --> 00:09:48,600
I'm doing this for my sister,

203
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:49,440
not for you.

204
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,440
If it affects Jiaojiao's seal,

205
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:52,639
I won't forgive you.

206
00:09:54,399 --> 00:09:55,159
Yes, yes.

207
00:09:55,679 --> 00:09:58,240
You're the best in the capital.

208
00:09:58,679 --> 00:10:00,720
And Tang Xin cherishes

209
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,600
your pick very much.

210
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:09,120
This is carved wood.

211
00:10:09,519 --> 00:10:11,360
Dip it in ink and cover it on the silk paper.

212
00:10:11,759 --> 00:10:13,200
Then you don't have to copy it word by word.

213
00:10:13,519 --> 00:10:15,600
This way, the time cost is greatly reduced.

214
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:19,480
I didn't expect you to be so thoughtful

215
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:21,279
in doing things.

216
00:10:22,039 --> 00:10:22,639
Did you

217
00:10:23,159 --> 00:10:24,279
plan it all out already?

218
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,879
I started thinking as soon as

219
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:28,639
I saw those books.

220
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,519
Because you trust me,

221
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:33,759
I'll do my best.

222
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:36,679
I have some of my poetry books in the Moon God Pavilion.

223
00:10:36,679 --> 00:10:37,759
We can sell them with the novels.

224
00:10:38,679 --> 00:10:39,600
If it goes well,

225
00:10:39,879 --> 00:10:41,679
we'll see results in half a month.

226
00:10:41,919 --> 00:10:44,000
If the clients like our escort service,

227
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:45,080
we can offer them

228
00:10:45,159 --> 00:10:46,320
a buy-one-get-one-free deal,

229
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:48,240
which will double our orders.

230
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:50,840
Alright,

231
00:10:51,879 --> 00:10:52,720
let's do it your way.

232
00:10:53,279 --> 00:10:54,679
I'll go ask my grandpa for the seal.

233
00:11:04,039 --> 00:11:05,279
It's already in the yard.

234
00:11:05,679 --> 00:11:06,720
Take it, Mr. Su.

235
00:11:09,519 --> 00:11:10,440
What

236
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,399
are these books?

237
00:11:14,799 --> 00:11:15,279
They're for you.

238
00:11:16,039 --> 00:11:16,519
No charge?

239
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:17,600
No charge?

240
00:11:18,279 --> 00:11:19,159
Then I dare not read them.

241
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:20,799
As you wish.

242
00:11:21,279 --> 00:11:22,759
You can give the money you earn

243
00:11:22,799 --> 00:11:23,600
from selling these novels to Cheng Yicheng.

244
00:11:25,399 --> 00:11:26,480
Cheng Qi,

245
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:28,320
did you sell Cheng Yicheng to her?

246
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,720
I only sell, I don't buy.

247
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:33,039
He insisted on dedicating himself to her.

248
00:11:33,519 --> 00:11:34,279
I have no choice.

249
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:38,039
Congratulations.

250
00:11:41,879 --> 00:11:44,600
This book is a gift for your congratulations.

251
00:12:12,759 --> 00:12:13,360
My lady,

252
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:15,799
are you reading?

253
00:12:17,279 --> 00:12:17,720
Don't make noise.

254
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:21,360
Whose book is it

255
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:23,440
that can make you change?

256
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:24,960
I need to learn from it.

257
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:36,360
So you don't feel sleepy when reading?

258
00:12:37,759 --> 00:12:38,840
It's strange.

259
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:40,840
I'm not sleepy when I read this.

260
00:12:42,399 --> 00:12:43,600
The words are a little weak,

261
00:12:44,039 --> 00:12:45,559
but it's interesting.

262
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:47,159
But I always feel

263
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:49,399
this story is familiar.

264
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:52,840
Maybe

265
00:12:53,679 --> 00:12:56,039
all loving couples are the same.

266
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:59,320
If they really divorced,

267
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,360
they would be laughed at.

268
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,200
Well,

269
00:13:04,279 --> 00:13:06,279
if you divorce me,

270
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:08,799
would you be afraid of being made a joke of?

271
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:13,440
I...

272
00:13:15,159 --> 00:13:16,159
Who dares?

273
00:13:21,279 --> 00:13:22,080
Who's there?

274
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:33,960
What are you listening to here?

275
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:34,759
My Lord

276
00:13:34,759 --> 00:13:35,600
I... I just came here.

277
00:13:35,639 --> 00:13:36,519
I didn't hear anything.

278
00:13:36,919 --> 00:13:38,879
Don't come here at noon.

279
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:39,519
Do you hear me?

280
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:41,039
At noon.

281
00:13:41,279 --> 00:13:42,039
I remember it.

282
00:13:55,279 --> 00:13:56,440
Little escort.

283
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:58,919
Don't let anyone disturb them after noon

284
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:00,840
so that they can be alone.

285
00:14:02,519 --> 00:14:04,440
They must have feelings for each other.

286
00:14:13,559 --> 00:14:15,759
When can I open the door?

287
00:14:23,279 --> 00:14:23,519
Here you are.

288
00:14:23,759 --> 00:14:24,240
Thank you.

289
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:28,159
Here.

290
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:32,919
It's so pretty.

291
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:45,879
Thank you.

292
00:14:45,879 --> 00:14:46,320
Take it.

293
00:15:00,039 --> 00:15:00,480
Thank you.

294
00:15:08,279 --> 00:15:08,960
Thank you.

295
00:15:09,759 --> 00:15:10,440
Thank you.

296
00:15:11,399 --> 00:15:12,080
Thank you.

297
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:13,559
How's it going?

298
00:15:13,919 --> 00:15:14,559
Finished giving out over there?

299
00:15:14,559 --> 00:15:15,080
Smooth.

300
00:15:15,200 --> 00:15:15,840
Keep going.

301
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:34,559
There's even a surplus.

302
00:15:35,679 --> 00:15:36,399
Impossible.

303
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:39,240
You did the accounting yourself.

304
00:15:40,879 --> 00:15:42,399
It's not even a month.

305
00:15:42,559 --> 00:15:44,679
How did we get so many new clients?

306
00:15:46,159 --> 00:15:47,639
Thanks to the books

307
00:15:47,639 --> 00:15:48,919
you bought earlier.

308
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,720
We let them try our escort service

309
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:53,480
almost for free.

310
00:15:54,039 --> 00:15:55,639
And you've set strict rules

311
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:58,039
requiring all escorts to treat every order,

312
00:15:58,080 --> 00:16:00,240
no matter how small, with care.

313
00:16:00,879 --> 00:16:02,240
Once merchants use our services,

314
00:16:02,679 --> 00:16:04,320
they naturally see us as reliable,

315
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:05,279
and become repeat customers.

316
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:09,200
So this time,

317
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:11,600
we're riding the wave of the Xingyun Convention.

318
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:14,759
It's your foresight

319
00:16:14,799 --> 00:16:15,799
and planning that made it happen.

320
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:17,759
Actually,

321
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:20,240
I've also benefited from our escort agency,

322
00:16:22,039 --> 00:16:23,240
And thanks to my invention,

323
00:16:23,559 --> 00:16:25,080
the wooden copying machine.

324
00:16:28,879 --> 00:16:29,919
In that case,

325
00:16:31,159 --> 00:16:33,120
Jiaojiao, you should take over

326
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:35,799
the escort agency earlier.

327
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:51,639
Jiaojiao

328
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:53,440
Come here.

329
00:16:57,639 --> 00:16:58,360
Jiaojiao

330
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:01,200
The Escort Agency is thriving.

331
00:17:01,639 --> 00:17:02,399
In the future,

332
00:17:02,399 --> 00:17:04,440
there must be a daughter to inherit it.

333
00:17:06,799 --> 00:17:08,400
Now that you have such a good son-in-law,

334
00:17:08,839 --> 00:17:11,279
you should start a family as soon as possible.

335
00:17:12,119 --> 00:17:12,920
Grandpa,

336
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:14,680
what are you talking about?

337
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:27,000
My Lord,

338
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:28,119
I didn't lie to you, did I?

339
00:17:28,359 --> 00:17:29,079
They really need people.

340
00:17:32,559 --> 00:17:33,160
My Lord,

341
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:34,720
we've been working

342
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:35,920
in the capital for so long.

343
00:17:36,279 --> 00:17:37,880
But no one has ever treated us as human beings.

344
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:39,799
Why can't we be hired

345
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:40,880
by the Escort Agency?

346
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:44,680
We are bandits.

347
00:17:46,599 --> 00:17:47,759
If we have a chance to make a living,

348
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:49,519
who would like to be a bandit?

349
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:50,599
Can't we

350
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:52,640
have a chance to start over?

351
00:18:11,559 --> 00:18:12,680
This is the money from selling the booklet.

352
00:18:13,079 --> 00:18:15,519
After deducting the agency's expenses and the cost of the book,

353
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:16,240
this is what's left.

354
00:18:16,559 --> 00:18:16,920
Here you are.

355
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:21,519
This is the commission of the book.

356
00:18:21,599 --> 00:18:22,400
All here.

357
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:23,440
Here you are.

358
00:18:24,559 --> 00:18:25,519
This is your money.

359
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:26,400
Why do you give it to me?

360
00:18:26,559 --> 00:18:27,279
You are my wife.

361
00:18:27,279 --> 00:18:28,440
Of course, I should give it to you.

362
00:18:28,839 --> 00:18:29,480
Take it.

363
00:18:32,559 --> 00:18:34,160
I have such a good son-in-law.

364
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:37,119
I should have a baby as soon as possible.

365
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:39,920
I didn't expect

366
00:18:40,319 --> 00:18:42,440
these storybooks could sell for so much money.

367
00:18:43,839 --> 00:18:44,440
How about it?

368
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:45,559
I'm smart, right?

369
00:18:46,279 --> 00:18:48,559
Thanks to that unknown little book.

370
00:18:49,519 --> 00:18:51,119
Why don't you praise my songbook?

371
00:18:52,079 --> 00:18:54,079
Mainly because your writing is too literary.

372
00:18:57,079 --> 00:18:57,640
No.

373
00:18:57,839 --> 00:18:58,680
I mean,

374
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,759
you helped me silence my uncle this time.

375
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:03,599
Tell me,

376
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:04,559
what do you want?

377
00:19:04,720 --> 00:19:05,319
I'll do anything for you.

378
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:07,440
Anything?

379
00:19:09,240 --> 00:19:10,559
How about

380
00:19:10,559 --> 00:19:11,759
we start a family?

381
00:19:12,640 --> 00:19:13,400
Don't even think about it!

382
00:19:13,599 --> 00:19:14,599
I'm not having a family with you!

383
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:18,079
What are you thinking?

384
00:19:19,440 --> 00:19:21,079
My lady, where did your mind go?

385
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:22,200
I'm warning you,

386
00:19:22,359 --> 00:19:23,240
if you dare to do something wrong,

387
00:19:23,599 --> 00:19:23,880
I...

388
00:19:24,559 --> 00:19:25,440
I won't be nice to you.

389
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:28,319
My dear,

390
00:19:29,039 --> 00:19:31,400
I want you to write the final words for me.

391
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:34,240
Which eye of yours

392
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:35,759
thinks I can write?

393
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:38,039
I mean,

394
00:19:38,079 --> 00:19:38,759
I'll read it,

395
00:19:39,039 --> 00:19:40,559
and you can change it if you don't like it.

396
00:19:42,079 --> 00:19:42,880
To be honest,

397
00:19:43,279 --> 00:19:45,640
I think your speech is good,

398
00:19:46,279 --> 00:19:47,680
but I don't really understand it.

399
00:19:50,119 --> 00:19:51,599
Then I'll keep changing it until you do.

400
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:54,319
Why does it sound

401
00:19:54,640 --> 00:19:55,599
like you're not serious?

402
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:57,000
Just tell me yes or no.

403
00:20:01,559 --> 00:20:03,160
♪Smooth face with painted eyebrows♪

404
00:20:03,519 --> 00:20:04,920
♪Orioles sing and swallows dance♪

405
00:20:05,839 --> 00:20:07,440
♪Lightly brushed♪

406
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:09,559
♪The fragrance lingers in the bridal chamber♪

407
00:20:10,319 --> 00:20:11,920
♪Last night's whispers were filled with longing♪

408
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:15,359
The silver candle flickered and swayed.

409
00:20:17,119 --> 00:20:19,039
Why does it feel a bit improper?

410
00:20:20,319 --> 00:20:21,000
Then I'll change to another one.

411
00:20:22,880 --> 00:20:24,319
Clouds, trees, and sandy embankment.

412
00:20:25,599 --> 00:20:27,200
Willows and small bridges.

413
00:20:27,839 --> 00:20:30,519
The market is lined with pearls and jewels, reflecting the bright moon.

414
00:20:31,880 --> 00:20:33,279
The red canopy exudes fragrance.

415
00:20:33,519 --> 00:20:35,160
Phoenix curtains and silk screens.

416
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:38,640
Silk fills the house, intoxicating the world.

417
00:20:43,160 --> 00:20:44,440
Okay, I'll try another one.

418
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:49,079
The moonlight shines for years.

419
00:20:49,720 --> 00:20:51,119
The waves are endless.

420
00:20:52,240 --> 00:20:54,440
The sky is high, clouds light, rain fine.

421
00:20:55,119 --> 00:20:57,400
Missing you day and night.

422
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,079
Jiao,

423
00:21:06,240 --> 00:21:07,039
I can't hold on.

424
00:21:07,039 --> 00:21:07,720
I can't help you.

425
00:21:08,279 --> 00:21:09,440
I'll go escort the goods first.

426
00:21:17,920 --> 00:21:20,559
Why has business in this city decreased so much?

427
00:21:21,240 --> 00:21:22,559
It's all been taken over by the Su family.

428
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:24,039
The Sus?

429
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:26,680
Su Liwei

430
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:27,720
is getting bold.

431
00:21:28,519 --> 00:21:29,319
It must be

432
00:21:29,359 --> 00:21:31,279
the idea of that matrilocal man.

433
00:21:31,839 --> 00:21:33,039
He's selling his books

434
00:21:33,359 --> 00:21:35,680
with free escorts.

435
00:21:36,119 --> 00:21:37,880
Many merchants find it attractive

436
00:21:38,039 --> 00:21:38,920
and went to him.

437
00:21:39,119 --> 00:21:40,680
Why don't you do the same?

438
00:21:40,920 --> 00:21:42,079
and give away something?

439
00:21:42,839 --> 00:21:44,160
I did.

440
00:21:44,319 --> 00:21:46,200
And I even paid extra to hire some managers back.

441
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:47,680
But I lost more and more money.

442
00:21:54,359 --> 00:21:55,920
Where has Su Li been recently?

443
00:21:56,359 --> 00:21:58,960
He's either at the casino or at Huayue Tower every day.

444
00:22:01,359 --> 00:22:03,039
Let's go and see him.

445
00:22:04,839 --> 00:22:05,519
Come on.

446
00:22:07,039 --> 00:22:07,799
Waiter.

447
00:22:13,759 --> 00:22:14,599
Mr. Su.

448
00:22:16,640 --> 00:22:17,279
Fifty taels.

449
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:18,640
Please pay first.

450
00:22:20,039 --> 00:22:20,640
What do you mean?

451
00:22:21,279 --> 00:22:22,400
I just sat down.

452
00:22:22,880 --> 00:22:23,920
I haven't ordered anything yet.

453
00:22:24,160 --> 00:22:25,039
You want me to pay?

454
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:28,000
The Old Master said

455
00:22:28,440 --> 00:22:29,720
you need to pay

456
00:22:29,960 --> 00:22:31,640
for the drinks in advance.

457
00:22:34,920 --> 00:22:36,000
Well, I won't eat here.

458
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:38,480
Fifty taels.

459
00:22:47,400 --> 00:22:48,519
Stealing my business, huh?

460
00:22:49,119 --> 00:22:50,880
How dare you!

461
00:22:51,279 --> 00:22:52,440
Well,

462
00:22:52,920 --> 00:22:54,559
I'm not doing anything right now.

463
00:22:57,319 --> 00:22:58,319
You lost your money?

464
00:22:58,319 --> 00:22:59,400
Yeah.

465
00:23:00,880 --> 00:23:02,440
If I could steal your business,

466
00:23:02,720 --> 00:23:04,079
I would have done it long ago.

467
00:23:07,400 --> 00:23:08,039
Mr. Fu,

468
00:23:08,839 --> 00:23:09,799
do you still need people?

469
00:23:10,119 --> 00:23:11,000
Take me in.

470
00:23:13,079 --> 00:23:15,119
If you still have the Su's Escort Agency,

471
00:23:15,279 --> 00:23:16,799
I can think about it.

472
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:18,519
But now,

473
00:23:19,160 --> 00:23:20,640
I think you'd better forget it.

474
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:26,720
I don't want to go there.

475
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:28,440
That girl should

476
00:23:28,759 --> 00:23:29,880
take all your business.

477
00:23:38,359 --> 00:23:39,200
Gong Xi, Fa Cai.

478
00:23:39,480 --> 00:23:39,920
My son-in-law,

479
00:23:40,240 --> 00:23:41,359
I have a question for you.

480
00:23:41,880 --> 00:23:43,200
How did you write this script?

481
00:23:44,359 --> 00:23:44,759
My dear,

482
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:45,960
do you think it's not good?

483
00:23:46,920 --> 00:23:47,599
Simple and easy to understand.

484
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:48,640
I'm not as good as him.

485
00:23:49,519 --> 00:23:51,079
Some plots are written by him according to my idea.

486
00:23:52,920 --> 00:23:54,519
No wonder some parts

487
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:56,279
are simple and plain.

488
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:58,759
My dear, are you praising

489
00:23:58,960 --> 00:23:59,799
or cursing me?

490
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:02,440
What else does your boss like to read

491
00:24:02,519 --> 00:24:03,480
except for scripts?

492
00:24:03,640 --> 00:24:04,680
She doesn't read

493
00:24:05,519 --> 00:24:06,319
any type of book.

494
00:24:08,240 --> 00:24:10,000
Because she grew up escorting with her mom.

495
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:11,880
She took over the Escort Agency at a young age.

496
00:24:11,960 --> 00:24:12,519
So

497
00:24:12,519 --> 00:24:14,440
she's not interested in anything except escorting.

498
00:24:16,559 --> 00:24:17,599
But why

499
00:24:18,759 --> 00:24:19,920
do you write scripts?

500
00:24:20,079 --> 00:24:21,839
Because I was young when I came here.

501
00:24:21,880 --> 00:24:23,000
My Lord knew I wanted to study,

502
00:24:23,079 --> 00:24:24,279
so she hired a teacher to teach us.

503
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:25,799
She said as long as we were willing to learn,

504
00:24:25,839 --> 00:24:26,680
she would help us.

505
00:24:29,839 --> 00:24:31,559
It seems she didn't attend the class.

506
00:24:31,839 --> 00:24:32,359
I did.

507
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:34,440
But I slept too deeply

508
00:24:34,480 --> 00:24:35,720
and was kicked out by the teacher.

509
00:24:36,559 --> 00:24:37,200
Go, my son-in-law.

510
00:24:40,480 --> 00:24:41,759
Wait for me.

511
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:47,559
I need to think of another way.

512
00:24:53,160 --> 00:24:55,519
My lady, this is the novel from the escort agency.

513
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:57,119
It sells well in Yunjing.

514
00:24:57,759 --> 00:25:00,680
It's all about the married couples.

515
00:25:05,400 --> 00:25:06,440
So vulgar.

516
00:25:17,720 --> 00:25:20,079
Did Zhang Qijia go to the City of Diamond recently?

517
00:25:20,359 --> 00:25:20,720
Yes.

518
00:25:21,079 --> 00:25:23,519
I heard that the young master took some young masters with him.

519
00:25:23,839 --> 00:25:25,640
He probably won't be back before the final exam.

520
00:25:26,319 --> 00:25:27,480
Then let's make it quick.

521
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:28,319
Post the list today.

522
00:25:29,480 --> 00:25:30,400
For the banquet,

523
00:25:31,039 --> 00:25:32,440
let them bring their families.

524
00:25:33,359 --> 00:25:34,039
I'll get it done right away.

525
00:25:45,920 --> 00:25:48,839
The Starry Night Gala final is in seven days.

526
00:25:49,079 --> 00:25:50,279
[There will be two rounds.]

527
00:25:50,920 --> 00:25:52,240
[The first round is the flying flower order.]

528
00:25:52,359 --> 00:25:53,720
[The theme will be announced on the spot.]

529
00:25:54,119 --> 00:25:55,640
[The final round is the poetry gathering.]

530
00:25:56,039 --> 00:25:57,680
[The theme is the prosperity of the Yun State.]

531
00:25:57,960 --> 00:25:58,920
[The form is not limited.]

532
00:25:59,039 --> 00:26:00,240
[You can invite performers.]

533
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:19,440
Time to eat.

534
00:26:19,440 --> 00:26:20,000
I'm starving.

535
00:26:20,279 --> 00:26:20,839
Let's eat.

536
00:26:25,240 --> 00:26:25,880
Okay.

537
00:26:25,960 --> 00:26:26,799
Everyone's here.

538
00:26:27,000 --> 00:26:27,640
Let's eat.

539
00:26:28,160 --> 00:26:28,640
Wait.

540
00:26:32,359 --> 00:26:32,920
Guys,

541
00:26:33,319 --> 00:26:35,279
I need your help.

542
00:26:36,759 --> 00:26:38,039
We're family.

543
00:26:38,039 --> 00:26:39,200
Just say it.

544
00:26:41,119 --> 00:26:43,559
You all have been around the country,

545
00:26:43,759 --> 00:26:44,680
and seen a lot.

546
00:26:45,440 --> 00:26:47,720
Could you tell me the happiest

547
00:26:47,720 --> 00:26:48,759
and most joyful thing in the Yun State?

548
00:26:50,359 --> 00:26:51,039
What?

549
00:26:51,960 --> 00:26:52,960
Happiness?

550
00:26:53,720 --> 00:26:54,960
Just tell Cheng Qi

551
00:26:54,960 --> 00:26:56,440
the happy things you've met

552
00:26:56,720 --> 00:26:57,680
in your escort years.

553
00:26:58,880 --> 00:27:00,559
Happy things.

554
00:27:02,559 --> 00:27:03,599
Zhen,

555
00:27:03,720 --> 00:27:05,720
when I was pregnant with Yu'er,

556
00:27:06,279 --> 00:27:09,079
I had braised pork from Huayue Restaurant for the first time.

557
00:27:10,160 --> 00:27:12,240
I was so happy

558
00:27:14,519 --> 00:27:16,359
that I kissed Su.

559
00:27:21,839 --> 00:27:24,000
It turns out that the braised pork Grandpa loves

560
00:27:24,240 --> 00:27:25,519
is not just a dish,

561
00:27:25,920 --> 00:27:27,279
but your memory.

562
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:30,519
Later, this Yunjing

563
00:27:30,640 --> 00:27:31,680
changed too fast.

564
00:27:31,680 --> 00:27:32,680
Things and people are different.

565
00:27:32,880 --> 00:27:34,920
Even the owner of Huayue Tower has changed.

566
00:27:35,480 --> 00:27:36,680
But that night

567
00:27:36,680 --> 00:27:39,200
was the happiest time of my life.

568
00:27:40,920 --> 00:27:42,160
However,

569
00:27:43,359 --> 00:27:46,599
this house is getting bigger and bigger,

570
00:27:47,640 --> 00:27:48,920
but without Zhen,

571
00:27:49,880 --> 00:27:51,759
it feels empty.

572
00:27:52,119 --> 00:27:53,160
Empty?

573
00:27:53,440 --> 00:27:55,079
I can't even find a place to put more carriages.

574
00:27:56,279 --> 00:27:57,440
No romance.

575
00:27:59,920 --> 00:28:00,640
It's my turn.

576
00:28:01,640 --> 00:28:02,440
I'm happiest

577
00:28:02,839 --> 00:28:03,880
when

578
00:28:04,720 --> 00:28:06,079
Tang Xin smiles at me.

579
00:28:08,319 --> 00:28:09,079
I...

580
00:28:10,519 --> 00:28:11,400
With a whip in hand,

581
00:28:11,880 --> 00:28:12,720
I can do anything.

582
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:14,240
Speed and passion

583
00:28:14,440 --> 00:28:16,519
are the source of my happiness every day.

584
00:28:18,960 --> 00:28:21,319
There are more and more young ladies selling rouge.

585
00:28:23,440 --> 00:28:25,880
I mean, there are more escorts delivering rouge.

586
00:28:26,160 --> 00:28:27,160
There are also cakes and fruits.

587
00:28:27,480 --> 00:28:29,160
I enjoy escorting these.

588
00:28:32,400 --> 00:28:33,559
The happiest moment

589
00:28:33,680 --> 00:28:35,119
is when I see the clients

590
00:28:35,319 --> 00:28:36,839
showing their gratitude after each escort.

591
00:28:37,279 --> 00:28:38,400
And also,

592
00:28:42,559 --> 00:28:44,640
when my parents escorted goods with me.

593
00:28:49,680 --> 00:28:51,640
Is the final exam really that difficult?

594
00:28:52,279 --> 00:28:52,880
Maybe I should

595
00:28:53,000 --> 00:28:54,880
ask around tomorrow.

596
00:28:55,119 --> 00:28:55,519
No need.

597
00:28:55,920 --> 00:28:56,799
I'll think about it.

598
00:29:37,160 --> 00:29:37,599
What...

599
00:29:38,079 --> 00:29:38,960
What's going on?

600
00:29:43,440 --> 00:29:45,480
I'm really stuck right now.

601
00:29:49,440 --> 00:29:49,960
My dear,

602
00:29:50,160 --> 00:29:51,839
why don't you have a drink with me?

603
00:29:53,119 --> 00:29:53,440
I...

604
00:29:53,799 --> 00:29:54,799
I won't drink.

605
00:30:00,920 --> 00:30:03,079
Maybe after you take a sip,

606
00:30:03,240 --> 00:30:04,599
I'll suddenly get an idea.

607
00:30:05,440 --> 00:30:06,640
What idea?

608
00:30:06,720 --> 00:30:08,640
It's just an excuse for your drinking.

609
00:30:10,759 --> 00:30:11,559
Come on, please.

610
00:30:11,720 --> 00:30:12,519
Please.

611
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:39,960
Any ideas yet?

612
00:30:41,960 --> 00:30:43,079
Want another drink?

613
00:31:03,160 --> 00:31:03,720
Jiao.

614
00:31:05,079 --> 00:31:06,519
Jiao, you didn't drink much.

615
00:31:06,519 --> 00:31:07,559
How come you're so drunk?

616
00:31:08,720 --> 00:31:13,240
Jiao also wants to escort to Klak City.

617
00:31:13,359 --> 00:31:14,680
Where are you going?

618
00:31:14,720 --> 00:31:16,039
Go to bed.

619
00:31:17,799 --> 00:31:19,039
Why is your face so red?

620
00:31:19,640 --> 00:31:20,640
Are you having a fever?

621
00:31:29,319 --> 00:31:30,519
Mom.

622
00:31:32,440 --> 00:31:33,440
Look.

623
00:31:34,519 --> 00:31:36,160
There's a juggler.

624
00:31:39,240 --> 00:31:39,839
Mom.

625
00:31:41,160 --> 00:31:42,039
Is this my mom?

626
00:31:44,039 --> 00:31:45,000
Mom.

627
00:31:45,680 --> 00:31:47,680
That storyteller

628
00:31:48,079 --> 00:31:50,519
is not as good as Cheng Qi.

629
00:31:51,680 --> 00:31:52,799
Who is Cheng Qi?

630
00:31:54,359 --> 00:31:55,279
Cheng Qi

631
00:31:55,720 --> 00:31:57,880
is the best storyteller

632
00:31:58,079 --> 00:32:00,759
in the entire Yun State.

633
00:32:03,279 --> 00:32:05,519
Is he that good in your heart?

634
00:32:08,319 --> 00:32:09,960
There's a light in his eyes.

635
00:32:10,720 --> 00:32:13,440
And just like you,

636
00:32:13,839 --> 00:32:15,640
he also calls me Jiao.

637
00:32:17,039 --> 00:32:18,279
He...

638
00:32:18,279 --> 00:32:19,519
is very important to you.

639
00:32:24,440 --> 00:32:25,079
Mom,

640
00:32:25,960 --> 00:32:26,880
look,

641
00:32:27,880 --> 00:32:29,519
those Lang Yue people

642
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:31,920
are dancing.

643
00:32:32,119 --> 00:32:34,839
They look so happy.

644
00:32:36,920 --> 00:32:39,519
Let's go dance too.

645
00:32:53,079 --> 00:32:53,960
Alright.

646
00:32:55,599 --> 00:32:57,200
Jiao has grown taller.

647
00:32:57,519 --> 00:32:58,559
The dress is too short.

648
00:32:59,960 --> 00:33:03,440
Can I be an escort now?

649
00:33:06,079 --> 00:33:07,720
Do you like being an escort?

650
00:33:12,480 --> 00:33:15,400
I want to be like you.

651
00:33:16,880 --> 00:33:17,759
I hope

652
00:33:18,160 --> 00:33:20,960
Jiao can do what she wants to do.

653
00:33:21,960 --> 00:33:23,480
Even if it's just peace and joy,

654
00:33:24,200 --> 00:33:25,160
it's also good.

655
00:33:27,640 --> 00:33:29,960
I like being an escort.

656
00:33:30,680 --> 00:33:32,720
Every time I see the client

657
00:33:33,200 --> 00:33:35,000
receiving the expected items

658
00:33:35,960 --> 00:33:37,880
and meeting the person they want to see,

659
00:33:38,200 --> 00:33:40,079
I feel happy too.

660
00:33:41,720 --> 00:33:43,119
Just like Cheng Qi,

661
00:33:43,960 --> 00:33:45,519
who loves writing lyrics,

662
00:33:46,759 --> 00:33:50,359
he doesn't find it hard at all.

663
00:34:03,960 --> 00:34:04,680
Jiao, be good.

664
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:05,559
Stay here.

665
00:34:05,960 --> 00:34:06,960
I'll be back soon.

666
00:34:17,239 --> 00:34:18,039
Mom,

667
00:34:19,199 --> 00:34:21,000
come back soon.

668
00:34:27,719 --> 00:34:28,519
Mom,

669
00:34:31,039 --> 00:34:33,159
why haven't you come back?
